摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Progressive tool-parameter documentation for DeepSeek Harness native TypeScript PTC, with a reproducible 78-tool evaluation","id":"gh:1432809534","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-tool-discovery","slug":"degraw4/dsh-tool-discovery","topics":["agent-tools","benchmark","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Progressive tool-parameter documentation for DeepSeek Harness native TypeScript PTC, with a reproduc"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ible 78-tool evaluation"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Tool Discovery"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Keep frequent tool inputs complete. Load complex parameter details only when needed.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A plugin for DeepSeek Harness and its TypeScript Programmatic Tool Calling (PTC) runtime. PTC lets a"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"n agent call several tools from one program. This plugin keeps useful signatures in the model's tool"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" SDK and places detailed documentation in conversation history on demand."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文 · Design · Evaluation · Reproduce"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"1. Small schemas and tools listed in `alwaysInline` keep complete parameters in the SDK.\n2. Other la"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"rge schemas retain the tool name, description, top-level argument names, types, required fields, and"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" return type. Nested details are deferred.\n3. The model calls `tool_help` with exact tool names or a"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" configured group. Complete schemas return as tool results, without expanding the static SDK.\n4. Exe"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"cution still uses native tool registration, scope checks and full parameter validation. Documentatio"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"n lookup grants no permissions."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"A fixed SDK avoids changing its prefix during documentation discovery. It does not guarantee provide"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"r cache hits. The host chooses frequent tools before execution; there is no query-keyword router."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Recorded engineering result"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Across four spreadsheet tasks and **40 successful executions per strategy**, selective documentation"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" with two frequent tools kept inline used **6.5% less estimated model cost** and **3.1% fewer model "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"requests**, with essentially unchanged mean elapsed time."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Metric | Full PTC | Selective PTC with frequent tools inline | Change |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---:"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" |\n| Successful executions | 40 | 40 | — |\n| Usage-based estimated cost | ¥6.7084 | ¥6.2718 | **−6.5"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"%** |\n| Model requests | 416 | 403 | **−3.1%** |\n| Mean elapsed time | 63.92s | 63.83s | −0.1% |\n| N"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"on-cached input tokens | 1,385,262 | 1,217,760 | **−12.1%** |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Both configurations use `deepseek-flash`, high reasoning, a 65,536-token output limit, and 78 real M"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"CP tools. Nine complex tool inputs use deferred details in the candidate. Offline SDK size is 92,682"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" → 72,587 UTF-8 bytes (−21.7%); this is not a token measurement. Two tasks are adapted from public T"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"oolathlon tasks; two are derived tasks using its public spreadsheet data."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Each task and strategy has ten repeat positions, using the first normally completed, artifact-verifi"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ed execution at each position. The four tasks were used during development; they are not an official"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" Toolathlon leaderboard submission. Costs use recorded API usage and frozen rates. See method and re"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"thlon leaderboard submission. Costs use recorded API usage and frozen rates. See method and results."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Try it"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"This source release is not published to npm. Use a built DSH checkout at `d743267388641bc76f17c45ce8"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ase is not published to npm. Use a built DSH checkout at `d743267388641bc76f17c45ce8b4c231aed1d32c`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Mount `lib/tool-docs.mjs` as a Cordis plugin using TypeScript PTC. See configuration and setup."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Recompute the recorded numbers without a model, credentials or data downloads:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Repository contents"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Location | Purpose |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `src/` | Scoped documentation lookup, pagination, minimum signatures and SDK rendering |\n| `tests/"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"` | Lifecycle, scope, signature, schema and frequent-tool checks |\n| `bench/` | Public task retrieva"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"l, real tool servers, deterministic graders and fixed-schedule runner |\n| `results/` | Numerical exe"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"cution records, per-request usage and a reproducible report |\n| `patches/` | Shared MCP output metad"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ata and spreadsheet inspection support |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Upstream workbooks and original evaluators are downloaded at pinned revisions. Credentials, private "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"tool collections, full conversations and generated workbooks are not distributed."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Project code is MIT. Upstream code and datasets retain their terms; see third-party notices."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
